ential Serum! \n\nEyelashes can take up to four to six weeks to come and go. You may have experienced an adjustment that took place during a particular transition of your growth cycle. Since everyone is different, people experience results at differing rates. We have seen that the longer you use Babe lash, the better your results will be. \n\n Babes can typically see results as early as week 4, but we recommend reviewing your results at week 12. Patience and Consistency are key! \n\n We offer a 90 Day Satisfaction Guarantee and want you to have an exemplary Babe experience. We recommend taking full advantage of our 90-day Satisfaction Guarantee to allow enough time for your body to acclimate to this new product. \n\nIf you have any additional feedback or questions please contact us directly at info@babeoriginal.com","created_at":"2025-07-17T18:58:47","display_name":"Melanie@BabeLash","comments_avatar":"https://cdn-yotpo-images-production.yotpo.com/App/403387/138062879/thumb.png?1728054556"},"user":{"user_id":132944085,"social_image":null,"user_type":"AnonymousUser","is_social_connected":0,"display_name":"kallista"},"language":"en"},{"id":914495422,"score":5,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":0,"content":"Love this stuff, works slower than the gold tube, but doesnt bother my eyes at all","title":"Love this stuff, works slower","sentiment":0.9875399,"created_at":"2026-10-28T02:23:58.000Z","deleted":false,"verified_buyer":true,"source_review_id":null,"custom_fields":null,"product_id":789378060,"is_incentivized":false,"incentive_type":null,"images_data":null,"comment":null,"user":{"user_id":63629088,"social_image":null,"user_type":"User","is_social_connected":0,"display_name":"Kristin S."},"language":"en"},{"id":911142484,"score":5,"votes_up":0,"votes_down":0,"content":"I got a recommendation and was hesitant before I decided it was worth a try. I couldn't be happier with my results","title":"Satisfied","sentiment":0.94918346,"created_at":"2026-10-24T04:25:26.000Z","deleted":fal